          "- finance_accounts.delinquency_status in (Current, Past Due, Delinquent, Payment Plan). Overdue money = balance_due where status in (Delinquent, Past Due).\n",
          "- aid_appeals.status is pending/approved/denied; requested_amount_usd is additional aid requested.\n",
          "- budget_vs_actual: negative variance_pct = under budget. GPA is US 4.0 scale. Data is synthetic.\n"
